2. Overview
Philippine Check Writer is a check-writing utility for Philippine banking standards. The App lets you:

Create and preview checks
Print checks or save them as PDF
Manage payees, drafts, and check history
Optionally sign in to sync data across devices (Premium)
Purchase a Premium subscription through Google Play
You can use many App features without creating an account. When you are not signed in, your check data is stored locally on your device only.

