5. Local Storage vs. Cloud Storage
Without an account
All data stays on your device in local app storage (AsyncStorage). Uninstalling the App removes this local data unless you have separately saved PDF exports elsewhere.

With a free account
Your account credentials and usage count are stored on our Supabase backend. Check data, payees, and history remain primarily on your device unless you upgrade to Premium.

With a Premium account
When signed in with an active Premium subscription, the App syncs the following to Supabase:

Payees (name, contact, address, notes)
Check history (payee, amount, date, status, check number, purpose)
Drafts
Print settings and calibration preferences
Sync uses encrypted HTTPS connections. Data is protected by row-level security so each user can access only their own records.

