10. Security
We take reasonable measures to protect your information, including:

HTTPS encryption for all network communication with our backend
Encrypted secure storage for authentication session tokens on mobile devices
Row-level security (RLS) in our database so users can access only their own data
Server-side purchase verification — Premium status is never trusted from the client alone
No method of transmission or storage is 100% secure. You are responsible for keeping your account credentials confidential and for securing your device.

